#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "68_Man"
msgid "Excuse me... Is this where I can find the Sodachi Dojo?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "92_Sodachi"
msgid "Yes. Can I help you with something? If you're selling newspapers, we're not interested."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "104_Man"
msgid "I'm not selling anything... I came to ask if I could be an apprentice at this dojo. Do you have any room?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "116_Sodachi"
msgid "An a... a... apprentice!? Saejima-san! Did you hear that!? We got our second apprentice!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "128_Saejima"
msgid "Oh? What's yer name?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "140_Man"
msgid "I'm Takehiro Ehama. I worked in an office until a little while ago. I'm embarrassed to say it, but I have no fighting experience."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "152_Sodachi"
msgid "That's no problem at all! I don't have any either!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "164_Ehama"
msgid "What? Are you joking? I'm beginning to have second thoughts about this place..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "176_Saejima"
msgid "Relax. We've trained champions here. And I'm the teacher, not 'im."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "188_Ehama"
msgid "Oh, that's a relief. It's a pleasure to meet you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "200_Sodachi"
msgid "My name is Sodachi and this is Saejima-san. Shall we go ahead and start training then?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "212_Ehama"
msgid "But I didn't bring anything to train in. What should I do?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "224_Sodachi"
msgid "No worries at all! I have everything you will need. Let's go ahead and get you changed!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Saejima"
msgid "What the hell?"
msgstr "¿Qué diablos?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "308_Sodachi"
msgid "It's an original Sodachi Dojo Masked Man Set! Everything was ordered and made specially for the dojo. Man, what a good investment!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "320_Saejima"
msgid "This is exactly why this place ain't got no money. Ya don't have to wear that, y'know. Ain't it embarrassin'?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "332_Ehama"
msgid "Actually, I feel surprisingly good, like I'm a new person. This works for me!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "344_Sodachi"
msgid "Great! I'm glad you get what a great outfit this is! Now we're getting in the groove! Introducing the one and only, Sodachi Dojo Masked Man!"
msgstr ""
